**/AGENTS.md
README.md
docs/

# The Dockerfiles themselves don't need to be in the build context's COPY
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
Dockerfile.e2e

# Secrets and live sessions must never enter a build context
.env.test
.env.local
.auth
playwright-report
test-results
blob-report
